  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/418f56abc640a0f997.png\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא יָרוּם הַלֵּב,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא יִשְׁכַּח כְּאֵב,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנָשִׁים אַחִים אֲנַחְנוּ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא יַרְבֶּה סוּסִים,<br />זָהָב, נְשָׁפִים,&nbsp;נָשִׁים,</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יְרָא&nbsp;אֶת אֱלֹהֵינוּ.</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לְחֹם מִלְחֲמֹתֵנוּ.</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מנהיגות אמיתית נמדדת בענווה, בהתרחקות מכוח וממון, ובהליכה תמידית ביראת ה'.</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span data-end=\"72\" data-start=\"33\">וַיִּגְבַּהּ לִבּוֹ בְּדַרְכֵי ה' </span>(דברי הימים ב', י\"ז ו) - עשה!<br /><span data-end=\"160\" data-start=\"124\">לְבִלְתִּי רוּם לְבָבוֹ מֵאֶחָיו</span>&nbsp;(דברים י\"ז כ) - לא תעשה!</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div></span><div><span><span><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מֶלֶךְ = 90 = מַיִם</span><br /><span><span><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-family: arial;\">\"פַּלְגֵי מַיִם לֶב מֶלֶךְ בְּיַד ה' - עַל כָּל אֲשֶׁר יַחְפֹּץ יַטֶּנּוּ\" (משלי כ\"א א)</span><p><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-family: arial; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><br /></span></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; font-family: arial; text-align: -webkit-center;\"></span></p><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><b>נֹתֵן</b></span>' / '<span style=\"color: black;\">יָהֵיב</span>'<br /></span></span>❖ מתן, יהב - בנק יהב<span>.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'<span style=\"color: black;\"><b>אָשִׂימָה</b> (עָלַי)</span>' / '</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">אֲמַנֵּי (עֲלַי)</span>'<br /></span></span>❖<span>&nbsp;להציב בראש, להמליך - מינוי.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><b>סְבִיבֹתָי</b></span>' / '</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">בְסַחְרָנָי</span>'<br /></span></span>❖<span>&nbsp;במעגל, מסביב - סחור סחור.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><b>אֵיכָה</b></span>' / '</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">אֵיכְדֵין</span>'<br /></span></span>❖<span>&nbsp;איך קרה דבר זה - איך (איך)&nbsp;דֵין&nbsp;(זה)</span>.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #626262;\">'</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\"><b>בַיַּעַר</b></span>' / '</span><span style=\"color: #626262;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">בְּחֻרְשָׁא</span>'<br /></span></span>❖<span>&nbsp;מקום גידול אילנות - חורש.</span></span></li></ol><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">👁️ מבט חד<br /></h2><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שְׂרָרָה אֲנִי נוֹתֵן לָכֶם?</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עַבְדוּת אֲנִי נוֹתֵן לָכֶם!</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/9af517cf5c2dc8559a.png\" style=\"clear: right; float: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 1em; text-align: right;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"168\" src=\"/assets/images/content/9af517cf5c2dc8559a.png\" width=\"168\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div></div><div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\">כתר או אזיק?<br /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"מֶלֶךְ אָסוּר בָּרְהָטִים\" (שיר השירים ז' ו)</span></div></span></div></span></span></div></div>"
}
